EXPANDED-SOURCE-BEGIN
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BATCTL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-RC PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN.
           CALL 'DATEVAL' USING WS-RC
           IF WS-RC NOT = 0 MOVE 12 TO RETURN-CODE STOP RUN END-IF
           CALL 'CUSTUPD' USING WS-RC
           CALL 'ACCTPST' USING WS-RC
           CALL 'BALSUM' USING WS-RC
           CALL 'RPTGEN' USING WS-RC
           MOVE WS-RC TO RETURN-CODE
           GOBACK.
EXPANDED-SOURCE-END
